<title>CHINA: China Jan-Feb copper output up 11.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Feb copper output up 11.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>China produced 145,900 tonnes of copper in the first two months of this year, up 11.9 percent compared with the same period in 1996, the State Statistical Bureau said on Thursday.</p>
<p>China produced 77,100 tonnes of copper in February alone, the bureau said. It gave no comparative figure.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
